True Self was added in '''Beta 55.0''' as a Token for Self Reflection and recreating of [[Snow Storm]], the card that got removed for these to take its place, being a 6G spell that kills all non-paralyzed monsters on the board. '''Beta 55.1''' increased its cost to 7G.

=== Stats ===
Main spell giver: Self Reflection

Cost:

* 6 (Beta 55.0)
* 7 (Post Beta 55.1, Current)

Effect: Kill all non-paralyzed monsters.

Rarity: Green (Generated)

=== Trivia ===

* Snow Storm's latest version, since Beta 28.0, killed all Paralyzed monsters, thus the opposite targets of True Self.
** Additionally, it was always 7G with that effect, the same cost as that of True Self since Beta 55.1.

